    "title": "Dante Moore carted off after scary hit in USC game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jackson Demmler ,\n8 hours ago LOS ANGELES, Cal -- Los Angeles Memorial Coliseum went completely silent as Oregon football quarterback Dante Moore was carted off the field after suffering a hit to the head. In the second quarter of Oregon's Big Ten opener at No. 12 USC, Dante Moore found an opening and used his legs to move the Ducks offense. Read full article",
